{
  "name": "Fool's Insight",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ability to gather stories and lore gains a supernatural edge. You can cast detect thoughts up to a number of times equal to your Charisma modifier. You regain any expended uses of this ability after completing a Long Rest.</p><p>If a creature resists your attempt to probe deeper and succeeds at its Saving Throw against your detect thoughts, it immediately suffers an embarrassing social gaffe. It might loudly pass gas, unleash a thunderous burp, trip and fall, or be compelled to tell a tasteless joke.</p>",
